// `del self` inside a method body: migrated from compile_err (was a
// compile-time rejection) to a runtime safety error. 本测试 receiver 是栈变量,
// del self 作用于栈 receiver: delete 前提 is_heap(p)(键最高位
// msb 0 = 栈)拒绝栈指针, 前提不满足 → fail-stop →
// Exit code 1。
//
// 语义声明: 本计划定义 del self 在堆 receiver 上释放 receiver 自身为
// **预期语义**(is_raw 兜底);本次迁移只覆盖栈 receiver safety error 场景。

struct S {
    v: i32,
}

impl S {
    pub fn bad() {
        del self;
    }
}

fn main() {
    let s = S(1);
    let r: S& = &s;
    r.bad();
}
